subtitle": "Present Moment", "category": "Mindfulness", "icon": "🔎", "color": "#D4A017", "duration": "5 min", "type": "guided", "description": "Choose one object and observe it completely. A simple but powerful mindfulness practice.", "steps": ["🎯 Choose an object near you.\nPick any natural or simple object: a plant, a stone, a candle, a piece of fruit.", "👀 Look at it as if for the first time.\nForget what you know about it. See it fresh.", "🔍 Notice its visual details.\nShape, color, texture, light, shadow, imperfections. What do you actually see?", "✋ If you can, touch it.\nNotice its weight, temperature, texture. How does it feel in your hand?", "💭 Notice any thoughts or judgments.\nWhen your mind wanders (it will), gently return to the object.", "🌊 Observe the act of observing.\nNotice that you are aware. The part of you that is noticing — what is that?", "💜 Close with gratitude.\nThank this simple object for its role in this moment of presence."]}]''',
